name fwlw
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc Get first and last words of a page
relocated 1
longdesc The package extracts the first and last words of a page,
longdesc together with the first word of the next page, just before the
longdesc page is formed into the object to print. The package defines a
longdesc couple of page styles that use the words that have been
longdesc extracted.
